Immediately, the affair becomes a massive scandal. The <span style="color: #DE0100;">Republicans</span> grill us on multiple fronts; we've lost billions of dollars of US military equipment, 11 soldiers have lost their lives, and we've been completely humilated on the world stage. Our polling numbers have suffered a massive hit. For now, our response has been to claim the withdrawal was always going to be messy, and to hope that a sucessful domestic agenda will lead to Americans putting this affair behind them by the time important elections come up.
